        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956470/extras/015d40b3fa24cb4d86863909298aaf79.avif?t=1779210232\" width=800 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     Nightmare King is a pixel-art roguelike bullet hell shooter where you choose a hero to enter dream maps. Survive wave after wave of monsters to become the “Nightmare King.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     Each hero possesses unique passive skills and starting weapons. Through combat, you can refresh the shop to upgrade weapons and gear, crafting your own specialized playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     If you love pixel art, dazzling effects, satisfying mowing-down action, and strategic builds, don't miss out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-shooting for easy accessibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced action with 20 waves per session, totaling about 30 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop freely to build your playstyle: melee blades, magic spells, ranged bows/guns, summoning, survival loot, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive by maneuvering to collect coins, XP, and healing apples—accumulate wealth through extreme survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of characters, each with unique mechanics for distinct combat feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectible encyclopedia to unlock more weapons and gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple maps delivering varied monster pressures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable difficulty for endless self-improvement through trials.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Full Content List</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>42 distinctive playable characters:</strong> Dragonborn, Witch, Elf, Nun, Necromancer, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>80+ weapons:</strong> Greatswords, Staffs, Grimoires, Bows, Lasers, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>170+ pieces of gear:</strong> Stat boosts, counterattacks on damage, shop discounts, skill activation on pickup, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 arena maps:</strong> Catacombs, Sewers, Lawns, Cemeteries, Beaches, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956470/extras/9e4d433a205d129d6ec9c8f7ee42b768.poster.avif?t=1779210232\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956470/extras/9e4d433a205d129d6ec9c8f7ee42b768.webm?t=1779210232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956470/extras/9e4d433a205d129d6ec9c8f7ee42b768.mp4?t=1779210232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956470/extras/015d40b3fa24cb4d86863909298aaf79.avif?t=1779210232\" width=800 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     Nightmare King is a pixel-art roguelike bullet hell shooter where you choose a hero to enter dream maps. Survive wave after wave of monsters to become the “Nightmare King.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     Each hero possesses unique passive skills and starting weapons. Through combat, you can refresh the shop to upgrade weapons and gear, crafting your own specialized playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     If you love pixel art, dazzling effects, satisfying mowing-down action, and strategic builds, don't miss out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-shooting for easy accessibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced action with 20 waves per session, totaling about 30 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop freely to build your playstyle: melee blades, magic spells, ranged bows/guns, summoning, survival loot, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive by maneuvering to collect coins, XP, and healing apples—accumulate wealth through extreme survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of characters, each with unique mechanics for distinct combat feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectible encyclopedia to unlock more weapons and gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple maps delivering varied monster pressures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable difficulty for endless self-improvement through trials.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Full Content List</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>42 distinctive playable characters:</strong> Dragonborn, Witch, Elf, Nun, Necromancer, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>80+ weapons:</strong> Greatswords, Staffs, Grimoires, Bows, Lasers, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>170+ pieces of gear:</strong> Stat boosts, counterattacks on damage, shop discounts, skill activation on pickup, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 arena maps:</strong> Catacombs, Sewers, Lawns, Cemeteries, Beaches, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956470/extras/9e4d433a205d129d6ec9c8f7ee42b768.poster.avif?t=1779210232\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956470/extras/9e4d433a205d129d6ec9c8f7ee42b768.webm?t=1779210232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956470/extras/9e4d433a205d129d6ec9c8f7ee42b768.mp4?t=1779210232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Dive into a nightmare-ridden world in this fast-paced roguelite! Choose from 42 characters, 84 weapons, and 176 items to forge your own build. Battle through 8 maps, slay hordes of monsters, level up, collect gold, and upgrade. Can you survive the endless nightmare?",
